{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30009_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b7f774b23309d281397e2310fb183a676be8651b29082fe6f59cf20259a139f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21f466959b384a6122bfb71493baa3fc3836b36ad31ffca7b7eda120ee873b3c",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95058e429b96b86db2c5904191163643fb8b77a034ebd0d02bdccc2e97685e67",
      "text": "“想拥有这样的婚姻！”特辑吗。\n再次在杂志上读到，还挺让人不好意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39207e08b5f0c827e02b5e623720afff8b0b44fbc709c6a2aedf5c89d0981e81",
      "text": "不过，大家的神情都很不错。\n特别是龙的这张照片，很有安全感，真棒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5218d219dfef7b9ee209ea64166253d439f9c6dcacab5d41da270436e3309fa6",
      "text": "啊，这是接住摄影师先生时的照片呢。\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39fb56cc42d5bd7ee5a94572cb5f1c7e8c0ab5b1a97df0b7726930bd8b232fcb",
      "text": "杂志的销量似乎也非常喜人哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10619cea84d7399810db48eacb4cedfeb3c34b8d68799aed390956d58ab977f4",
      "text": "我家里人好像也买了……一想到\n客厅里就摆着这个，感觉有点难为情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cba47b477fbb4e1ee3e820b351d5392de7b12507bdc8b00dd437fcf737c49efe",
      "text": "我家那边也是一样啊。\n而且大家还人手买了一本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a32b53ceb9b12158822a440cb447883fd88e27420cdccf5a4bbe5653b878b184",
      "text": "哈哈，虽然确实让人略感害羞，\n不过能得到支持，也是一件值得感激的事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c9a6acd73484cadbaa87a695350a4d1615ead52a6074bbaa6ed97e5e1f607d5",
      "text": "说的也是。起初还不知道会变成什么样，\n能拍出好照片真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:398db1ee1566e721c170f90a68f1a08cf3855c7817732b9ab2f047919b94cacb",
      "text": "接触了不熟悉的领域，\n总觉得自己的戏路和业务范围也拓宽了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_k:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfe6e515a9b3747eee894b76184348b7823f4a7e92f4a86bf5fcb642b3931a97",
      "text": "能接下这份工作真是太好了。\n●●●●プロデューサー，下次也请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
